  "name": {
    "ja": "HG 1/144 ナラティブガンダム C装備 [覚醒イメージカラー]",
    "en": "HG 1/144 Narrative Gundam C equipment [Awakening image color]"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 2530,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2023年08月05日 (土)",
    "year": 2023,
    "month": 8,
    "day": 5
  },
  "targetAge": 8,
  "scale": "1/144",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム NT』に登場する「HGUC 1/144 ナラティブガンダム C装備」が劇中のシーンをイメージした”覚醒イメージカラー”になって登場！",
      "en": "The \"HGUC 1/144 Narrative Gundam C Equipment \" that appears in \" Mobile Suit Gundam NT \" is now available in \" Awakening Image Color\" based on the scene in the play!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• サイコフレーム部分は劇中をイメージしたラメ入りのクリアブルーを採用。",
      "en": "• The psycho frame part uses clear blue with glitter, which is inspired by the movie."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 機体各部装甲もサイコフレームの反射をイメージした成形色に一部変更し、まさしく覚醒状態と呼ぶにふさわしい、劇中終盤をイメージした美しい仕上がりに。",
      "en": "• The armor on each part of the aircraft has also been changed to a molding color that resembles the reflection of the Psycho Frame, creating a beautiful finish that is reminiscent of the final stages of the play, which is truly worthy of being called an awakened state."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• パーツ分けにより腹部のコア・ファイターや脚部の色分けを再現。ユニコーンガンダムを想起させる意匠を全身に纏っている。",
      "en": "• By dividing the parts, the core fighter of the abdomen and the color coding of the legs are reproduced. The entire body is decorated with a design reminiscent of the unicorn Gundam."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• C装備で初めて装備するビーム・ライフル、サイコフレーム付属のシールドをセット。左右の握り手に加え、武器持ち用の右手パーツも付属。",
      "en": "• Beam rifle equipped for the first time with C equipment, Seal with psycho frame included. In addition to the left and right hand grips, a right hand part for holding a weapon is also included."
    }
  ],
